<title>USA: AT&amp;T wins tax okay, sees NCR spinoff in '96.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T wins tax okay, sees NCR spinoff in '96.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T said Corp on Thursday the U.S. Internal Revenue Service had ruled its planned distribution of shares in its NCR Corp computer unit as tax free for the company and NCR and AT&amp;T shareowners.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T said in a news release it expects to distribute shares in NCR Corp to AT&amp;T shareowners by year's end.</p>
<p>The demerging AT&amp;T concluded a spinoff of its majority holdings in Lucent Technologies Inc on September 30 and sold its majority position in AT&amp;T Capital Corp to a consortium of investors on October 1.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1713</p>
</text>
